<title>UK: State Development Bank of China sets $300 mln bond.</title>
<headline>State Development Bank of China sets $300 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Lehman and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE DEVELOPMENT BANK OF CHINA</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    01.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-03.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  65 BP     LISTING    NONE	SPREAD  +80-82 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		  S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A3/BBB    DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	YANKEE BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
